            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.115.4+PSA.115.5+PSA.115.6+PSA.115.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Chiny. 115.4-7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.135.15+PSA.135.16+PSA.135.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "135.15-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.5.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan. 5.23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Babaandu boosi ba barama abo, boosi bakheerwa ne lufu luno tawe, se bekanila nibio babeene baba ne bakholile tawe. Se balekha khusaaya bisieeno, namwe bifwaani bie sahabu, efwesa, kumukasa, libaale ne kumurongooro, bibiindu bikhabona namwe biaulila, namwe biakeenda tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
